3 of those are not topic names Forgejo accepts. No request was made: "not a topic" contains ' '; a topic may only hold letters, digits and hyphens; "-leading-hyphen" starts with '-'; a topic must start with a letter or a digit; "xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx" 36 characters; Forgejo allows at most 35
